{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05076","headline":"同狱者叹狱中无燕 · 沈佺期","name":"同狱者叹狱中无燕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何许乘春燕，多知辨夏台。\n三时欲并尽，双影未尝来。\n食蕋嫌丛棘，衔泥怯死灰。\n不如黄雀语，能雪冶长猜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}